### 1. Реєстрація
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artem",
  "email": "artem@gmail.com",
  "password": "qwerty123"
}

### 2. Логін
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "artem@gmail.com",
  "password": "qwerty123"
}

### 4. Логін із неправильним паролем
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "artem@gmail.com",
  "password": "qwerty"
}
